```
Or find the card with applications > 0.
This guarantees the modal opens with 1 live applicant, renders unclipped, and yields 8/8 100% GREEN!

[LEAD SUPERVISOR — EXACT SURGICAL SPEC FIX FOR DIR-010 STAGE 4]

Cline, the component changes are LANDED (loading prop plumbing). But the TEST SPEC has ZERO changes. You need exactly TWO edits in tests/e2e/dir010-recruiter-portal.spec.js:

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
EDIT 1: Fix resolveTargetJobFromMariaDb() (lines 210-228)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The current implementation returns null because require$mysqlConnection() sets connection = null.

Replace the ENTIRE block (lines 210-228) with this synchronous MariaDB query:

```js
function resolveTargetJobFromMariaDb() {
    if (resolveTargetJobFromMariaDb._cached) return resolveTargetJobFromMariaDb._cached;
    try {
        const { execFileSync } = require('node:child_process');
        const raw = execFileSync('node', ['-e', `
            const mysql = require('mysql2/promise');
            (async () => {
                const conn = await mysql.createConnection({
                    host: '127.0.0.1', user: 'root', password: '', database: 'ai_resume_builder'
                });
                const [rows] = await conn.query(
                    'SELECT a.job_id AS jobId, j.title, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM applications a JOIN jobs j ON a.job_id = j.id GROUP BY a.job_id, j.title ORDER BY cnt DESC, a.job_id ASC LIMIT 1'
                );
                await conn.end();
                if (rows.length) console.log(JSON.stringify({ jobId: rows[0].jobId, title: rows[0].title, rows: Number(rows[0].cnt) }));
                else console.log('null');
            })();
        `], { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 10_000, stdio: ['ignore', 'pipe', 'ignore'] }).trim();
        const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
        resolveTargetJobFromMariaDb._cached = parsed;
        return parsed;
    } catch (error) {
        return null;
    }
}
```

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
EDIT 2: Fix the assertion race (lines 569-573)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Replace lines 569-573:
```js
        const headerText = (await page.locator('#job-applications-title').innerText()).trim();
